{"speciesId":18,"names":{"fr":"Roucarnage","es":"Pidgeot","en":"Pidgeot","ja":"ピジョット"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"When hunting, it skims the surface of water at high speed to pick off unwary prey such as MAGIKARP."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"When hunting, it skims the surface of water at high speed to pick off unwary prey such as MAGIKARP."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"This POKéMON flies at Mach 2 speed, seeking prey. Its large talons are feared as wicked weapons."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Its well-developed chest muscles make it strong enough to whip up a gusty windstorm with just a few flaps."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It spreads its beautiful wings wide to frighten its enemies. It can fly at Mach 2 speed."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"Its outstanding vision allows it to spot splashing MAGIKARP, even while flying at 3300 feet."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"This POKéMON has a dazzling plumage of beautifully glossy feathers. Many TRAINERS are captivated by the striking beauty of the feathers on its head, compelling them to choose PIDGEOT as their POKéMON."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"This POKéMON has a dazzling plumage of beautifully glossy feathers. Many TRAINERS are captivated by the striking beauty of the feathers on its head, compelling them to choose PIDGEOT as their POKéMON."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"This POKéMON has gorgeous, glossy feathers. Many TRAINERS are so captivated by the beautiful feathers on its head that they choose PIDGEOT as their POKéMON."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It spreads its gorgeous wings widely to intimidate enemies. It races through the skies at Mach-2 speed."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"When hunting, it skims the surface of water at high speed to pick off unwary prey such as MAGIKARP."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"By flapping its wings with all its might, PIDGEOT can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"By flapping its wings with all its might, PIDGEOT can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"By flapping its wings with all its might, PIDGEOT can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its well-developed chest muscles make it strong enough to whip up a gusty windstorm with just a few flaps."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It spreads its beautiful wings wide to frighten its enemies. It can fly at Mach 2 speed."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"En battant des ailes de toutes ses forces, Roucarnage génère une rafale à en déraciner les arbres."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"By flapping its wings with all its might, Pidgeot can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"En battant des ailes de toutes ses forces, Roucarnage génère une rafale à en déraciner les arbres."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"By flapping its wings with all its might, Pidgeot can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"By flapping its wings with all its might, Pidgeot can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"By flapping its wings with all its might, Pidgeot can make a gust of wind capable of bending tall trees."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il survole la surface de l’eau pour repérer une proie et plonge en piqué pour l’attraper."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando caza, vuela muy deprisa a ras del agua y sorprende a inocentes presas como Magikarp."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When hunting, it skims the surface of water at high speed to pick off unwary prey such as Magikarp."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"エサを 探すとき 水面 すれすれを 滑るように 飛んで コイキングなどを わしづかみにする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Roucarnage déploie ses ailes majestueuses pour effrayer ses ennemis. Il peut voler à Mach 2."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Para intimidar a su enemigo, extiende las increíbles alas que tiene. Este Pokémon vuela a una velocidad increíble."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It spreads its gorgeous wings widely to intimidate enemies. It races through the skies at Mach-2 speed."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"美しい 羽を 広げて 相手を 威嚇する。 マッハ２で 空を 飛び回る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ce Pokémon est doté d’un plumage magnifique et luisant. Bien des Dresseurs sont captivés par la beauté fatale de sa huppe et décident de choisir Roucarnage comme leur Pokémon favori."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"El plumaje de este Pokémon es bonito e hipnótico. Muchos Entrenadores se quedan embobados ante la belleza impactante de las plumas que tiene en la cabeza; lo que les lleva a elegir a Pidgeot como su Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"This Pokémon has a dazzling plumage of beautifully glossy feathers. Many Trainers are captivated by the striking beauty of the feathers on its head, compelling them to choose Pidgeot as their Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"美しい 光沢の 羽を 持つ ポケモン。 頭の 羽の 美しさに 心 奪われ ピジョットを 育てる トレーナーも 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ce Pokémon est doté d’un plumage magnifique et luisant. Bien des Dresseurs sont captivés par la beauté fatale de sa huppe et décident de choisir Roucarnage comme leur Pokémon favori."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"El plumaje de este Pokémon es bonito e hipnótico. Muchos Entrenadores se quedan embobados ante la belleza impactante de las plumas que tiene en la cabeza; lo que les lleva a elegir a Pidgeot como su Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","t